{
  "id": "tpl-dragon-quake",
  "schema": "template@1",
  "name": "動地剁落點環",
  "description": "施法瞬間在施法者周圍等分出 N 個落點，各自炸一次並搖一次畫面 —— 「地面被剁開一圈」。原作是在半徑 350 的環上每 30° 生一隻 3 秒壽命的傀儡，每隻對自己的腳下丟一次叢集火箭。⭐ 等分相位在這一族**不重要**（環是對稱的），所以 radial 的固定 +x 起始相位在這裡不是缺口。",
  "family": "dragon-quake",
  "status": "draft",
  "params": {
    "modelKey": {
      "type": "docRef",
      "default": "imported.tectonicfury"
    },
    "count": {
      "type": "number",
      "default": 12,
      "min": 2,
      "max": 12,
      "unit": "count"
    },
    "ringRadius": {
      "type": "number",
      "default": 350,
      "min": 100,
      "max": 2600,
      "unit": "wc3u"
    },
    "speed": {
      "type": "number",
      "default": 1625,
      "min": 100,
      "max": 2600,
      "unit": "wc3u"
    },
    "blastRadius": {
      "type": "number",
      "default": 150,
      "min": 50,
      "max": 1300,
      "unit": "wc3u",
      "optional": true
    },
    "scale": {
      "type": "number",
      "default": 1,
      "min": 0.1,
      "max": 20,
      "optional": true
    },
    "shakeAmplitude": {
      "type": "number",
      "default": 0.5,
      "min": 0.05,
      "max": 1,
      "unit": "ratio"
    },
    "shakeSec": {
      "type": "number",
      "default": 0.6,
      "min": 0.1,
      "max": 5,
      "unit": "s"
    },
    "impactLifeSec": {
      "type": "number",
      "default": 3,
      "min": 0.5,
      "max": 30,
      "unit": "s"
    },
    "damage": {
      "type": "scaling",
      "default": {
        "perRank": [
          0
        ],
        "ratios": []
      },
      "optional": true
    },
    "damageType": {
      "type": "enum",
      "values": [
        "magic",
        "physical",
        "true"
      ],
      "default": "magic"
    },
    "scatterBox": {
      "type": "number",
      "default": 750,
      "min": 100,
      "max": 2600,
      "unit": "wc3u",
      "inert": "本版不生效 —— 原作除了那一圈固定落點，還在**移動中**每隔一 tick 於龍頭周圍 750×750 的方框內隨機挑一點放一發 WarStompCaster。那是「跟著主體走的隨機散布」，而 spawnModelFx 的落點在施放當下就決定了；randomArea 能隨機挑點但綁不到一具移動中的模型身上。"
    }
  },
  "requires": [],
  "gapScore": 8,
